{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And he came to Shechem.</b> A place of calamity: in Shechem they violated Dinah; in Shechem they sold Joseph; in Shechem the kingdom of the House of David was divided from Israel and they made Jeroboam king, as is said (1 Kings 12:1): ״וילך רחבעם שכם כי שכם באו כל ישראל להמליך אותו״. Once the tribes were divided, they crowned Jeroboam there, and it was the seat of his kingdom, as is said (ibid.): ״ויבן ירבעם את שכם״."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 37, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:18:14.202971823Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}